WEBVTT

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.280
Coach Hanashima left us a message.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.550
He wants us to practice by ourselves today since he has something to do.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.890
The semifinals are coming up soon.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.960
But Coach Hanashima hasn't been coming to practice.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.160
I wonder why?

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:19.230
If I was the ref, that would have been a yellow card.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.730
Our last coach got so mad.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:26.240
You said it yourself. Just score. Nothing else matters.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.010
I'll conquer the nation with this team!

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:07.310
Okay, you guys?

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:13.110
We'll be practicing extra hard today in order to win the semis and the finals.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:17.950
We'll win, go to the city tournament, and then challenge the entire nation!

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:18.920
Got it?

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:19.920
Yes!

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.490
The entire nation?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:25.860
What are you saying, Coach? Our aim is to become number one in the galaxy.{I'm aiming to become number one in the galaxy!}

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:28.590
Oh yeah, that's right.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:30.700
You serious about that?

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:32.600
Yup, of course, really!{Yes, yes, yes!}

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:35.070
Don't get so hotblooded, Shou.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:37.400
Conquering the nation comes first.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.710
I see. You're right.

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:44.180
Anyway, Shou, what's this team's strong point?

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:45.740
Strong point?

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.750
To put it simply, the best part of this team.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.880
What's the reason that we keep winning?

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:56.790
Um, the Furuyas are quite strong!

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.460
Yes, that's right.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.760
You all acknowledge that, right?

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:05.360
Kota, Ryuuji, and Ouzou's power and skills are out of this world.

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:08.370
We need to use that strong point to the max.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.940
We're changing our tactics?

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:14.070
To something like what the Netherlands did in that video we borrowed?

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:15.570
Johan Cruyff.

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:17.680
Total Football?

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.310
No.

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:22.720
That's our long term goal, but we'll go with the usual for now.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:27.090
We'll use your abilities to the max using Yoi, Big Tri, and Build.{Yoi, Big Tri, Build. The three of you will use your abilities to the max.}

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:29.920
Then I can't shoot?

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:31.620
That's not it.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:34.530
If you get a chance to shoot, then go ahead and shoot.

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:38.930
But we'll be focusing our passes to the Furuyas from now on.

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:42.030
Are you saying that we can do whatever we want?

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:45.370
As long as you don't stray too far from our tactics.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.140
And we'll work on everyone's own strong points, too.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:52.680
Our own strong points?

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:55.150
What you are good at.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:58.950
Try to use your strengths and assist the Furuyas.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:01.650
If the Furuyas are being man-marked,

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:04.690
then the others have to create their own chances.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:07.890
What am I good at?

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.160
You should know yourselves.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.400
Think about it if you don't.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.030
This pertains to your own self.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:15.430
You should be able to find it yourself.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.870
By ourselves?

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:21.370
Uki's strong point is sticking to the opponent like glue.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.880
Oh yeah.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.750
Um...

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:30.880
I don't have any strong points.

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.950
That's not true.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.390
You are an important part of our team, Reika.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:38.220
Think about what only you yourself can do.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.260
Okay!

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:44.500
Okay! Let's start practice!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:47.530
Let's start with conquering the nation! Let's go!

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:48.570
Okay!

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.920
Conquering the nation, huh?

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:06.220
I've never really thought about that.

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:09.720
If we do beat the entire nation, and I'm the captain...

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:36.250
Finally the semifinals, eh?

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:44.060
Now that I look back, I didn't really think you'd make it this far when I recruited you as the coach.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:49.390
Well, that just shows how good I am at recruiting.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:51.000
Right, Naomi-kun?

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:01.440
Shou's been maturing match after match.{Shou's been maturing after every match.}

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:04.280
Is it because he became the captain?

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:05.240
Maybe.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:08.250
Papa, hurry up, hurry up!

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.980
Reika-chan's match is starting.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:13.120
Yes, yes. I'm coming right now.

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.750
Where's Reika-chan?

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:17.590
Okay!

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:20.230
Let's aim for the entire nation!

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:22.590
Okay!

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:24.200
Reika-chan!

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.070
Reika-chan!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.430
Mama! Papa!

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:33.910
Will she be okay? I'm so worried.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:37.510
They'll be kicking the soccer ball around! She might even trip!

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:39.710
I-I see.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.880
But it's soccer.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.350
Reika-chan!

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.860
It's starting, Rin-chan.

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:51.960
Yes, yes.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:53.690
Shou! Do your best!

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:54.730
Erika!

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:55.860
Go!

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:58.730
Big Tri!

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:03.840
Yes!

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:05.370
They scored already!

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:22.150
Yes!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:23.590
Erika scored!

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:29.390
Reika-chan!

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:38.570
Oh well.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.720
Good, good. 8-1 going into the half.

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:52.180
It's like we've won already.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:54.920
I feel like they're scoring too much.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:58.920
Everyone's maturing, it seems.

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:02.090
You're right. They look very confident.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:03.700
Masaru-chan, too.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:06.400
Okay! Just keep this up and have fun in the second half!

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.600
Yes!

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:19.380
All right!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:24.150
Yes!

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.420
Wow!

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:34.260
Awesome!

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:36.130
Do your best in the finals, too!

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.900
There were so many goals scored in that game.

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:40.900
If only you scored, too.

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:42.070
I'll score someday.

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:46.740
But Kota-kun's amazing. He got a double hat trick!

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.780
Outa-kun? You're the captain, right?

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:53.110
Yes, that's right.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:58.650
Listen. Please watch out and don't have my Reika-chan be in any more danger.

00:08:58.650 --> 00:08:59.920
Mama!

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:03.560
It's fine, Reika-chan. I have to tell him clearly.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:06.490
But it's my fault that the opponent scored.

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:07.490
What are you saying?

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:11.930
You just tripped a bit back then, but you could have gotten hurt!

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:12.900
Outa-kun!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:13.870
Y-Yes!

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.800
I've asked you, all right?

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:20.610
Come on, Reika-chan. Let's go.

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:21.610
Mama!

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:25.610
Being the captain is tough, Shou.

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:27.210
I-I guess.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.250
Time to eat!

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:36.150
Shou-kun, I'm really sorry about before.

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:41.960
I'll do my best so the opponent doesn't score.

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:45.400
Your mother's worried about you, so don't overdo it.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:49.940
But we're aiming for the entire nation, right?

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.570
For now, yes.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:55.970
If I don't defend properly, I'll just be a bother to everyone!

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:58.880
Besides...

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:04.050
I want to stand on the pitch when we do conquer the nation.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.850
I see. You're right!

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:12.490
Okay! Then you have to react to the ball faster!

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:14.630
I'll help you out!

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.700
Okay! I'll try!

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:21.270
It's the finals at last.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:26.970
Our opponent is the Matsuyama Sports Youths, 
who seem tougher than our previous opponent.

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:29.270
We'll win as long as we don't underestimate them.

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:31.080
Yes!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:35.280
Wow, it's like I'm holding the trophy already.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.520
I'm getting excited!

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:41.990
Hello.

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:47.830
It's starting!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:48.930
Big Tri!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:01.440
Matsuyama Sports Youths is 
pretty good. Their defense is solid.

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:03.580
Well, it's just starting.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:06.780
Big Tri!

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.250
Yes!

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:16.620
All right!

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:30.740
You have to move faster!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:32.700
Don't just wait for the ball!

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:33.610
Okay!

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:40.250
Okay, Yoi!

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:46.890
Yes!

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.950
Let's keep on scoring!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.790
Yes!

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:58.100
The first half is almost over. We have three points.

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:02.200
This doesn't really feel like the finals. It's quite relaxing.

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:07.510
A loose ball!

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:10.010
I must clear it this time!

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.610
Reika-chan!

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:29.590
You have to move faster!

00:12:29.590 --> 00:12:31.500
Don't just wait for the ball!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:32.660
Okay!

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:49.980
Reika-chan!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:52.750
Reika-chan!

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:05.030
They scored right before the whistle to end the first half!

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:07.430
Are you okay, Reika-chan?

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:10.640
Yes, I am, but it hurts a little.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.570
No!

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:15.610
Aren't you bleeding!?

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.580
Papa! Call the ambulance! The ambulance!

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:20.080
Mama, that's going too far.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:21.910
I'm fine!

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:23.750
No, you're not!

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:28.690
Hey! I told you already to watch out for her! This is too much!

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:31.320
I'm sorry, it just happened...

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:34.130
Mama, that wasn't Shou-kun's fault. It's because I...

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:35.330
Whatever!

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:40.400
Papa, lend her your shoulder. We're going to the hospital.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.870
No! I'm staying here!

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:43.700
Reika-chan...

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:45.270
Let me play until the end!

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:46.400
No way!

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.770
Come on, Dear.

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:48.610
Okay.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:50.580
Come on.

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:52.910
Is Saionji okay?

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:55.750
Reika-chan's mother said they're going to the hospital.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:58.220
What? It's that serious?

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:01.190
Not really.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:05.020
Hey, hey! We have no subs!

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:06.890
Hey! Wait! Hey!

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:10.400
If Reika-chan doesn't come back, we'll 
have only ten players for the second half.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:12.500
Well, things will work out.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.000
It won't affect us that much.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:19.470
In any case, we'll have to change our formation.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.740
Listen up.

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:25.240
Kota plays as the lone striker up top.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:27.050
Uematsu is the left wing.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.380
Ryuuji is the center forward.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.680
Uchimura is the right wing.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.720
Tanaka and Erika are the defensive midfielders.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.820
Our fullbacks will be Shou, Ouzou, Ukishima.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:36.990
Shou will fill in for Reika's position.

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:38.360
Ouzou's in the middle.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:41.630
I'm a right back?

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:43.160
What's the matter?

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.430
I've never played on the wings before.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:48.900
Any position is new to you, Shou-kun.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:51.570
Well, that's true...

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.340
But...

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:58.010
No! I want to stay here!

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.510
Let me play until the end!

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.550
What's the matter?

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:06.950
No, it's nothing.

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.890
This is a pain.

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:09.790
What's wrong?

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:13.320
Looks like she only bruised her knee,

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:16.430
but they want the doctor to look at it.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.660
That madam is making a mess out of this.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.530
So will she be back?

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:26.440
Her father said she will, but I doubt it.

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:33.880
So you came all the way here.

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:38.320
Yes. I was worried about what instructions you'd give them.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:42.090
But this is tough. Down to ten players.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:47.860
Yes, but this might happen in the 
future. It's good experience for them.

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:50.130
You're right.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:54.530
I'll tell you what I think after the match then.

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:55.830
Thank you.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.910
You have to move faster!

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.910
Don't just wait for the ball!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:06.680
Okay!

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:10.550
I told you already to watch out for her! This is too much!

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:15.620
Come on, the second half's starting!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:18.360
Put your heart into it and let's go!

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:21.690
Looks like Reika-chan's not coming back.

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:26.430
Even if you're down a player, you can win by playing your own brand of soccer!

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:27.600
Got it?

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:32.440
Looks like they're going with ten.

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:38.140
According to the rules, the game ends if you have less than seven players.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.210
We still have three more to go, so we're okay.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:43.150
Oh, really?

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.380
Where's the circle, Captain?

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:51.560
What's wrong? You've been acting weird.

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:54.090
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:16:54.930 --> 00:17:00.030
It's all my fault. I was telling her unnecessary things, so she...

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.670
Shou-kun, why are you saying that now?

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:05.900
What are you guys doing? We're starting!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:06.440
Oops.

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:10.410
Shou-kun! Just focus for now!

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.880
They didn't even form a circle...

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:23.690
I knew it. Everything looks different from here.

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.090
What should I do?

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:27.090
Shou! What are you doing!?

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:43.780
Shou-kun! Clear properly!

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:45.110
Keep it together!

00:17:45.110 --> 00:17:46.210
I-I'm sorry!

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:49.550
Hey, hey, they scored again!

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:51.180
Are they okay?

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:53.320
Onii-chan is doing terrible.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:55.050
I'm a bit worried.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:59.020
Once Shou gets into that mode, it's hard for him to return to normal.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:01.990
I must focus... Focus...

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:05.760
Hey, Shou! Where are your orders!?

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:07.370
Oh yeah!

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.200
Uh...

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:16.270
Ouzou-kun!

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:17.380
What is it?

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:19.180
Please change positions with me!

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.150
I'm fine with it, but can you do it?

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:24.620
I can!

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:30.990
Okay! If I'm in the same position...

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:34.490
Yes! Big Tri!

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:39.230
I'm over here! We can't do the Big Tri!

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.200
Oh yeah! It should've be Yoi!

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:51.040
What are you doing, Shou-kun!?

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:54.010
If you don't give us orders, we'll be all over the place!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.950
They tied it up.

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:59.380
This looks really bad.

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:02.190
Something unexpected happened, that's why.

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:07.730
It's all because Reika-chan got hurt.

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:10.090
This all happened because we're down one player.

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:13.060
It's all my fault.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:13.800
Shou-kun!

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:17.400
Mark your man closer!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:35.750
Ouzou-kun!

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:38.860
Not yet. You're not awake yet.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.400
What are you doing!?

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:46.260
That was for Saionji.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.400
Wake up!

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:53.840
Remember your strong points!

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:55.510
Your field vision and your booming voice!

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:58.540
If we lose like this, Saionji will not be happy.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:01.480
She has been trying her very best, too!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:07.520
If I can't defend properly, I'll just be a bother to everyone!

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:11.760
And I want to stand on the pitch when we conquer the nation.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.560
What's wrong? Is someone else hurt?

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:18.300
I'm fine!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.100
I'm sorry. I'm back now!

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:22.170
Huh?

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:25.540
Okay! For Reika-chan!

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:29.840
Isn't that a bit too much?

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:31.440
That should be enough.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:35.780
Okay! We can score when we take the ball back!

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:37.380
That's right.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.450
Yep.

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:41.220
Thank goodness. Looks like he's back.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:42.450
Such a simple guy.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:46.360
This makes no sense. No sense at all.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:51.660
I want to express this lack of sense using math.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:55.170
Yoi!

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:03.310
Sorry, Kota-kun.

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:09.750
Yes! The winning goal!

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:15.320
Yes!

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:18.060
We won! We won! We're district winners!

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:20.020
Yes!

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:26.000
You still allow the own goals?

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:30.500
Yes. Own goals are one of this team's strong points.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:31.700
I see.

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:34.240
Actually, I told them to play however they want.

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:37.180
You aren't stopping the triplets?

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:40.750
What I want them to do right now is to train the team's strong points,

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:44.680
score, and win. That is my conclusion.

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:47.490
I see.

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:49.490
Well, that's just like what you would do.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:52.390
We just have to see what happens.

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:53.220
Yes.

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:57.630
But your team is pretty interesting. Later.

00:21:57.630 --> 00:22:01.900
I have things to do, so I'll be going now. Do your best, then.

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:02.630
Yes.

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:03.700
Later.

00:22:03.700 --> 00:22:05.570
Thank you very much!

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:10.710
Come on, Papa. Slower, please!

00:22:10.710 --> 00:22:11.940
Reika!

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:15.510
I'm sorry for worrying all of you.

00:22:15.510 --> 00:22:17.250
Thank goodness you're back.

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:17.980
Eh?

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:20.720
Yeah! You can take part in the trophy ceremony!

00:22:20.720 --> 00:22:21.750
Then...

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:23.650
Yes! We won!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:24.860
Yes!

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:27.530
Everyone! Go back on the pitch!

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:29.330
The trophy ceremony is starting!

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:30.700
Okay!

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:41.310
Shou.

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:45.810
If something like this happens again, we'll all help you snap out of it.

00:22:45.810 --> 00:22:46.410
Eh?

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:47.750
I'm against violence!

00:22:47.750 --> 00:22:49.080
What are you saying?

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:52.650
All for one and one for all!

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:55.320
What's with that? I don't understand.

00:22:55.320 --> 00:22:56.650
Understand, then.

00:24:35.490 --> 00:24:38.090
Yes! We won the district tournament!

00:24:38.090 --> 00:24:40.360
We're having a party at Reika-chan's house today!

00:24:40.360 --> 00:24:42.530
What fabulous food!

00:24:42.530 --> 00:24:43.360
Eh?

00:24:43.360 --> 00:24:44.530
What's with the 3U?

00:24:44.530 --> 00:24:48.170
Are they quitting soccer and taking up martial arts?

00:24:48.170 --> 00:24:49.470
No! Ninjas!

00:24:49.470 --> 00:24:50.670
You kidding me!

00:24:50.670 --> 00:24:55.370
Next episode of Ginga e Kickoff!! 3U's Decision.
